@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 5
skinparam ArrowColor #526B7B
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #DFF1EF
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #526B7B
skinparam sequenceActorBorderColor #526B7B
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #9AAEB7
skinparam sequenceGroupBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
skinparam sequenceGroupBorderColor #7B919E
skinparam sequenceDividerBackgroundColor #EDF4FB
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFF3DF
skinparam noteBorderColor #B99557
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
hide footbox
autonumber
title SB-M06 — Preserve actual material, not current live substitutes
actor Applicant as U
participant "Application record" as A
participant "Submission record" as S
participant "Actual submitted material" as M
U -> A : Identify actual event and confirmed material
A -> A : Evaluate current authority
alt Denied
 A --> U : Denied; no history disclosure/change
else Authorized
 A -> S : Evaluate event / provenance / completeness
 U -> S : Explicitly request actual material capture
 S -> M : Preserve identified actual content
 M --> S : Actual complete / partial / failed capture
 alt Required actual material confirmed preserved
  S --> U : Identified captured set and provenance
 else Missing, partial or unsuccessful capture
  S --> U : Incomplete / failed; do not claim complete set
 end
end
note over A,M
Never substitute whichever live PDF exists later.
Source/resume/publication edits do not rewrite actual documents.
Correction or resubmission needs distinguishable context.
end note
legend bottom
Logical domain interaction, not runtime execution evidence.
Detailed proposed guards/policies retain their primary status.
endlegend
@enduml
